<title>INDONESIA: Unggul Indah 1996 net up to 41.27 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Unggul Indah 1996 net up to 41.27 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				41.27  vs   32.76</p>
<p>    Net sales				 368.09 vs   317.94</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	 284    vs   226</p>
<p>    Gross profit			    84.26  vs  80.25</p>
<p>    Operating profit			55.34  vs  57.41</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  47.05  vs  45.30</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		     110.90 vs  91.41</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Unggul Indah Corporation is a manufacturer of alkylbenzene, a raw material for detergents. The results were audited.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
